    "# Grablytic Nightly Build — 20260925 (`5e7dc07`)",
    "> **Rolling Pre-Release**: Built automatically from `main` branch with cutting-edge engine features, native platform hardening, and regression fixes.",
    "---",
    "## ✨ What's New & User Benefits",
    "- 🏎️ **Unstoppable Download Queues:** Cancelling active downloads or changing maximum concurrent downloads in Settings no longer stalls the download queue. Remaining items start immediately without hanging.",
    "- 🔄 **Smart Incomplete Download Resume:** If a download was interrupted, Grablytic now searches both your internal cache and your custom download folder. You can resume `.part` files right where you left off without wasting bandwidth.",
    "- 🧹 **Automatic Storage Hygiene:** Deleting a media download from your library now cleans up orphan thumbnail sidecars (`.jpg`, `.webp`), saving device storage while keeping shared artwork intact.",
    "- 📱 **Rock-Solid Background Downloads on Android:** Upgraded WakeLock and WifiLock management ensures your downloads keep running in the background when the screen turns off or while switching apps."
